Fluent UI System Icons
======================

The SVG icons under resources/icons/fluent/ are a curated subset of
Microsoft's "Fluent UI System Icons", redistributed unmodified under the
MIT License.

Source : https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-system-icons
Variant: 24px "regular" (and "filled" where noted)
Fetched: 2026-06-16 via scripts/assets/fetch_fluent_icons.sh

Files are renamed to semantic names (e.g. navigation/overview.svg) for project
organization; their contents are the original Microsoft assets.

Exceptions (project-authored, NOT Microsoft assets): actions/pause.svg,
actions/play.svg and actions/stop.svg are simple original glyphs drawn in the
same 24x24 style to fill gaps in the curated set; they share one optical weight
(12x12 bbox inset to 6..18) so they read consistently when rendered small inside
a progress ring. They are released under the same MIT terms.

